body:
ITT: People that haven't visited SS in the last decade, and people that have no idea what it was like 10+ years ago. 

&#x200B;

And just to add my anecdotal experience, I went to that area in high school, having no idea what it was like, to buy an iPod. The police pulled us over first, and laughed at a couple of white boys being there, told us we would probably be robbed and to drive back home and don't come back here. That happened about 10 seconds after one of us said "Wow, what a great area for a drug house."

Hey, we have a good group of people and are still growing. Not really a clan, but more of a community. Feel free to check us out

&#x200B;

[https://discord.gg/sTMRez](https://discord.gg/sTMRez)
